          "Id": "CH1GEPR_S1-1HOCODEC",
          "Title": "Sec. 1-1 - How Code designated and cited.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n                  \n                  <p>The ordinances embraced in the following chapters and sections shall constitute and\n                     be designated the \"Code of Ordinances, Lexington-Fayette Urban County Government,\"\n                     and may be\n                     so cited.\n                  </p>\n                  <p data-type=\"historynote\">(Ord. No. 89-74, § 1, 5-30-74)</p>\n                  <p data-type=\"refcharter\">Merger of county and city governments, § 1.01.</p>\n               </div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
